<title>USA: Continental Amer, Country Wide end talks.</title>
<headline>Continental Amer, Country Wide end talks.</headline>
<dateline>CORONA, Calif 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Continental American Transportation Inc and Country Wide Transport Services Inc said negotiations regarding the merger of the two companies were discontinued.</p>
<p>The two companies announced on September 13, 1996, the signing of a letter of intent to merge.</p>
</text>
